Package: com.nightvibes33.gif2ani
Name: Gif2Ani Rootless
Version: 3.5.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
Conflicts: com.nightvibes33.darkboot, com.wizage.gif2ani2, com.wizages.gif2ani
Replaces: com.nightvibes33.darkboot
Description: Crash-safe custom respring animations for BackBoard on rootless iOS 15 and 16. Gif2Ani 3.5.4 regenerates all 48 bundled Springy package sizes and SHA-256 values directly from immutable raw Git blobs and derives every download URL from the verified source commit and safe DEB filename. It provides 114 first-class themes: 12 offline procedural animations, 54 pinned CC0 GIF downloads, and 48 original Springy pack downloads from the verified MIT-licensed VirenMohindra/CydiaRepo catalog. Every download is previewed and staged before Apply; catalog files are checked by host, byte limit, SHA-256, package identity, archive paths, extracted size, frame count, dimensions, and decoded-memory limits. The tweak preserves user-selected scaling, background, repeat, and duration settings, discovers installed Springy and SnowBoard packs, supports safe GIF/ZIP/DEB/frame-folder import, and automatically quarantines unsafe BackBoard media.
Maintainer: NightVibes33
Author: wizages, rootless port by NightVibes33
Section: Tweaks
